==Rules==
{{ColosseumRule|Cooldown Equality}}

==Battleground==
*2 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*1 [[Devil Wife]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Li'l Bun Bun]]s spawn after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>, delay 50~53.33 seconds<sup>1,500f~1,600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Razorback]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Midnite D.|Midnite Ds]] spawn, delay 40~43.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,300f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Kang Roo]]s spawn, delay 46.67~50 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,500f</sup>.
**2 [[Ackey]]s spawn, delay 73.33~76.67 seconds<sup>2,200f~2,300f</sup>.
**3 [[Devil Wife|Devil Wives]] spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 46.67~50 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,500f</sup>.
**1 [[Razorback]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
**4 [[Li'l Bun Bun]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
If you defeat the enemies fast enough, you win. The Ackeys are dangerous if allowed to spawn. Since everything is midranged or melee at the start, you can use that to your advantage. On top of that, you get cash-heavy peons and the main threats appear upon base hit. Build up as much damage as possible, and use stallers and crowd-control like [[Sniper the Recruit (Super Rare Cat)|Sniper the Deadeye]], [[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cyberpunk Cat]].

==='''Recommended Units'''===
*[[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat's]] guaranteed [[Freeze]] against Dark can help deal with the Razorback while your other attackers deal with the other enemies, though make sure to take care of him beacuse if he dies you can't spawn another. It is recommended to utilize a Freeze Up [[Cat Combo]] to allow a single Bombercat to perma-Freeze Razorback.
*[[Aku Researcher (Rare Cat)|Cat Reasearcher]] is a valid option, as he constantly breaks the Midnite D.'s Shield so they don't shred your frontline.
*[[Ancient Egg: N004 (Special Cat)|Supercar Cat]] can be used here, though his Single Attack can cause him to hit a Kang Roo, Supercar Cat can also be used to deliver good damage to all enemies and pierce the Midnite D.'s Shield, plus a guaranteed [[Knockback]] to the enemies in this stage.

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
*[[Kai  (Uber Rare Cat)|Divine Kai μ]] is very useful here, as she has very good base HP which helps with the Li'L Bun Buns, and has shield pierce if talented. In addition to this, she has [[Shield Piercing]] as a Talent and target Aku as an Ultra Talent, which shreds the stage on her own due to the cooldown being reduced.
*[[Kaoru Hanayama (Uber Rare Cat)|Kaoru Hanayama]] is also a very good unit for this stage, as he provides a [[Massive Damage|massive]] amount of damage to the Aku enemies in this stage and still has a high damage output against non-Aku enemies.

